<p>Non-deliverable			     126	135    300</p>
<p>CCC stocks				    863	863  1,306</p>
<p>Total					 6,442    6,853 13,951</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 2,153    2,378   unq</p>
